      "statement": "The wiki staleness gate recomputes the digest each claim in openwiki/.claims records for its cited source — the whole file, or the cited line range — and reports the ones that no longer match, the ones whose file is gone, and the records it could not check as written; it needs no git and no model, runs at the pre-push stage, and can be bypassed with SKIP=openwiki-staleness.",
